menu "RoboHub SHT4x driver"

config RH_DRV_SHT4X
    bool "SHT4x temperature and humidity sensor"
    select RH_HAL_I2C
    select RH_HAL_TIMER
    default n
    help
      Sensirion's SHT40, SHT41 and SHT45 temperature and humidity sensors,
      reached through the I2C HAL and a timer the selected platform implements
      (robohub ADR-0026). An application that sets this gets the driver compiled
      in; one that does not pays for none of it.

endmenu
